#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:1
msgid "接入 Jetson / 树莓派"
msgstr "Integrating with Jetson / Raspberry Pi"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:3
msgid "本页目标"
msgstr "Goal of this page"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:6
msgid ""
"将 **HM-D20 或 HM-D13** 通过串口接入 Jetson、树莓派等 Linux 主控，并使用 `D20_ros_driver` 发布"
" ROS 定位话题。可使用产品标配的 **3.3 V USB 转 UART 转接器**，也可使用主板的 **3.3 V UART GPIO**。"
msgstr ""
"Connect **HM-D20 or HM-D13** to a Linux host such as Jetson or Raspberry "
"Pi via serial port, and use `D20_ros_driver` to publish ROS localization "
"topics. Use the supplied **3.3 V USB-to-UART adapter** or the board's "
"**3.3 V UART GPIO**."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:10
msgid ""
"接入前先完成差分链路 **4G 版本**先完成 [4G/CORS 配置](../differential-links/4g-"
"ntrip.md)；**LoRa 版本**先完成 [基站与移动站连接](../differential-"
"links/lora.md)。差分链路由设备内部完成，驱动读取设备已输出的定位结果。"
msgstr ""
"Before connecting, complete the correction link first. For the **4G "
"version**, first complete the [4G/CORS configuration](../differential-"
"links/4g-ntrip.md); for the **LoRa version**, first complete the [base "
"station and rover connection](../differential-links/lora.md). The "
"correction link is completed internally by the device, and the driver "
"reads the positioning results already output by the device."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:13
msgid "驱动可解析 NMEA 或 UBX；接线前按[固件与输出协议选择](../operation/firmware-output.md)确认当前输出。"
msgstr ""
"The driver parses NMEA or UBX. Before wiring, confirm the current output "
"in [Selecting Firmware and Output Protocol](../operation/firmware-"
"output.md)."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:15
msgid "接线安全边界与接入前检查"
msgstr "Wiring Safety and Pre-connection Checklist"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:17
msgid "请先完成以下检查，再给设备上电："
msgstr "Complete the following checks before powering the device:"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:19
msgid "**供电：5 V ±0.5 V（4.5–5.5 V）**。主板直连时，使用 Jetson/树莓派 40-pin 的 5 V 电源脚。"
msgstr ""
"**Power: 5 V ±0.5 V (4.5–5.5 V)**. For direct host wiring, use a 5 V "
"power pin on the Jetson or Raspberry Pi 40-pin header."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:20
msgid ""
"**信号电平：UART 和 PPS 均为 3.3 V**。主控 GPIO UART 也必须是 3.3 V；禁止使用 5 V UART 或 "
"RS232。"
msgstr ""
"**Signal levels: UART and PPS are both 3.3 V**. The host GPIO UART must "
"also use 3.3 V logic; do not use 5 V UART or RS232."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:21
msgid "**接线：TX/RX 交叉，GND 共地**。必须按 Pin 顺序核对线束，不能按颜色判断；电源正极接入信号脚可能损坏设备。"
msgstr ""
"**Wiring: cross-connect TX/RX and share GND**. Verify every wire by pin "
"number, not by color; connecting the positive supply lead to a signal pin"
" may damage the device."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:23
msgid ""
"设备接口定义：[D20 接口与接线](../operation/d20-wiring.md) · [D13 "
"接口与接线](../operation/d13-wiring.md)。 树莓派 UART 脚位参考 [pinout.xyz UART "
"定义](https://pinout.xyz/pinout/uart)；Jetson 请查阅与实际型号和载板对应的官方 40-pin 定义。"
msgstr ""
"Device pinouts: [D20 Interfaces and Wiring](../operation/d20-wiring.md) ·"
" [D13 Interfaces and Wiring](../operation/d13-wiring.md). For Raspberry "
"Pi UART pins, see the [pinout.xyz UART "
"definition](https://pinout.xyz/pinout/uart). For Jetson, consult the "
"official 40-pin definition for your exact model and carrier board."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:26
msgid "接入前检查清单"
msgstr "Pre-connection checklist"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:29
msgid "[ ] 已核对设备型号及对应接口 Pin 定义。"
msgstr "[ ] The device model and corresponding pinout have been verified."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:30
msgid "[ ] 已核对主控型号、载板型号和 UART pinout。"
msgstr ""
"[ ] The host model, carrier-board model, and UART pinout have been "
"verified."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:31
msgid "[ ] 已确认 5 V ±0.5 V 供电、3.3 V UART/PPS 电平。"
msgstr "[ ] 5 V ±0.5 V power and 3.3 V UART/PPS logic have been confirmed."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:32
msgid "[ ] 已确认 TX/RX 交叉、GND 共地，线序而非颜色对应信号。"
msgstr ""
"[ ] TX/RX are cross-connected, GND is shared, and signals are matched by "
"pin order rather than wire color."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:34
msgid "串口权限、系统占用和 GPIO UART 启用由下方平台脚本检查和处理。"
msgstr ""
"The platform script below checks and handles serial permissions, system "
"conflicts, and GPIO-UART enablement."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:37
msgid "硬件接线"
msgstr "Hardware Wiring"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:39
msgid "连接方式 A：主板 UART 直连"
msgstr "Connection method A: Direct host UART"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:41
msgid ""
"5 V 直接接主控 40-pin 的 5 V 脚，UART 按下表交叉连接。D20 的完整 8-pin 定义、D13 的完整 5-pin "
"定义请分别查看设备接口页；PPS 不是 ROS 接入必需信号。"
msgstr ""
"Connect 5 V directly to a 5 V pin on the host 40-pin header and cross-"
"connect the UART as shown below. See the device interface pages for the "
"complete D20 8-pin and D13 5-pin definitions; PPS is not required for ROS"
" integration."

