#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:50
msgid ""
"Jetson Pin 8/10 仅作 **Jetson Nano 2GB Developer Kit（J6）**和 **Jetson Orin "
"Nano Developer Kit（J12）**官方载板的示例。其他型号、载板或第三方底板必须按实际 pinout 核对，不能直接套用。"
msgstr ""
"Jetson Pin 8/10 are examples for the official carrier boards of the "
"**Jetson Nano 2GB Developer Kit (J6)** and **Jetson Orin Nano Developer "
"Kit (J12)** only. For other models, carrier boards, or third-party "
"baseboards, verify the actual pinout and do not reuse this table without "
"checking."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:52
msgid "连接方式 B：标配 USB 转 UART 转接器"
msgstr "Connection method B: Supplied USB-to-UART adapter"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:54
msgid "使用产品随附的 USB 转 UART 转接器，按设备接口页连接 5 V、GND、TX、RX："
msgstr ""
"Use the supplied USB-to-UART adapter and connect 5 V, GND, TX, and RX "
"according to the device interface page:"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:56
msgid "转接器 USB 端插入 Jetson 或树莓派。"
msgstr "Plug the adapter's USB end into the Jetson or Raspberry Pi."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:57
msgid "转接器与设备 UART/PPS 均使用 3.3 V 电平；不要使用 5 V UART 转接器或 RS232。"
msgstr ""
"The adapter and device UART/PPS use 3.3 V logic; do not use a 5 V UART "
"adapter or RS232 interface."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:58
msgid "确认设备供电为 5 V ±0.5 V，TX/RX 交叉且 GND 已连接。"
msgstr ""
"Confirm 5 V ±0.5 V device power, cross-connected TX/RX, and a connected "
"GND."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:60
msgid "串口检测与数据读取"
msgstr "Serial Detection and Data Readback"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:62
msgid "完成接线后，按连接方式选择检测方法："
msgstr "After wiring, select the detection method for your connection:"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:64
msgid ""
"**USB 转 UART**：插入前后分别执行 `ls /dev/ttyUSB* /dev/ttyACM* "
"2>/dev/null`，比较列表，新增的设备即为设备串口。"
msgstr ""
"**USB-to-UART**: Run `ls /dev/ttyUSB* /dev/ttyACM* 2>/dev/null` before "
"and after plugging in the adapter. Compare the lists; the newly added "
"device is the serial port."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:65
msgid "**主板 GPIO 直连**：下载并运行对应脚本。脚本会配置 GPIO UART、处理权限和系统占用，并提供串口读取检查。"
msgstr ""
"**Direct host GPIO wiring**: Download and run the matching script. It "
"configures the GPIO UART, handles permissions and system conflicts, and "
"provides a serial readback check."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:67
msgid "中文页面下载："
msgstr "Downloads for the English page:"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:69
msgid "[Jetson GPIO UART 配置脚本（中文）](scripts/jetson_gpio_uart_zh.sh)"
msgstr "[Jetson GPIO UART setup script (English)](scripts/jetson_gpio_uart_en.sh)"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:70
msgid "[树莓派 GPIO UART 配置脚本（中文）](scripts/raspberry_pi_gpio_uart_zh.sh)"
msgstr ""
"[Raspberry Pi GPIO UART setup script "
"(English)](scripts/raspberry_pi_gpio_uart_en.sh)"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:72
msgid "脚本菜单按 **1 → 2 → 3** 顺序执行："
msgstr "Use the script menu in the order **1 → 2 → 3**:"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:74
msgid "配置 GPIO 串口（USB 转 UART 已可识别时可跳过）。"
msgstr ""
"Configure the GPIO UART (skip this step when the USB-to-UART port is "
"already recognized)."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:75
msgid "选择已确认的串口路径。"
msgstr "Select the confirmed serial-port path."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:76
msgid "读取串口数据，确认输出持续且正常。NMEA 可直接阅读；UBX 为二进制数据，终端中可能显示乱码，但持续读到数据即表示链路正常。"
msgstr ""
"Read serial data and confirm that output is continuous and valid. NMEA is"
" human-readable; UBX is binary and may look garbled in a terminal, but "
"continuous data confirms that the link is working."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:78
msgid "不要让多个程序同时打开同一串口。"
msgstr "Do not let multiple programs open the same serial port at the same time."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:80
msgid "安装驱动模块"
msgstr "Install the Driver"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:82
msgid "驱动源码：<https://github.com/Hessian-matrix/D20_ros_driver>"
msgstr "Driver source code: <https://github.com/Hessian-matrix/D20_ros_driver>"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:84
msgid "包名和可执行文件名均为 `d20_ros_driver`。"
msgstr "The package name and the executable file name are both `d20_ros_driver`."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:86
msgid "ROS1 Noetic"
msgstr "ROS1 Noetic"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:98
msgid "如果缺少 `empy`，安装 `python3-empy` 后重新编译。"
msgstr "If `empy` is missing, reinstall after installing `python3-empy`."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:100
msgid "ROS2"
msgstr "ROS2"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:112
msgid "配置驱动"
msgstr "Configure the Driver"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:114
msgid ""
"安装完成后、执行 launch 前，必须编辑驱动仓库中的 `src/d20_ros_driver/config/config.yaml`。ROS1"
" 和 ROS2 使用同一份配置，至少确认产品型号和 `serial_port`："
msgstr ""
"After installation and before launching, edit "
"`src/d20_ros_driver/config/config.yaml` in the driver repository. ROS1 "
"and ROS2 use the same configuration; at minimum, confirm the product "
"model and `serial_port` value:"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:126
msgid "`sku` 填写 `D20` 或 `D13`，`serial_port` 填写 Jetson/树莓派实际识别到的路径。"
msgstr ""
"`sku` should be filled in with `D20` or `D13`, and `serial_port` should "
"be filled in with the path actually recognized by Jetson/Raspberry Pi."

