#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:26
msgid "原始 NMEA；仅在 `publish_nmea: true` 时发布"
msgstr "Raw NMEA; only published when `publish_nmea: true`"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:155
msgid "状态约定：`-1` 无定位，`0` 普通定位，`1` RTK 浮点解，`2` RTK 固定解。"
msgstr ""
"Status Convention: `-1` No positioning, `0` Normal positioning, `1` RTK "
"Float solution, `2` RTK Fixed solution."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:173
msgid "接入完成判据"
msgstr "Integration success criteria"

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:176
msgid "定位话题持续发布，并能被驱动按当前输出协议解析；开阔环境进入固定解时，`NavSatFix.status.status` 为 `2`。"
msgstr ""
"The driver publishes the positioning topic continuously and parses the "
"current output protocol. When the receiver reaches a fixed solution with "
"an open sky view, `NavSatFix.status.status` is `2`."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:179
msgid ""
"设备在开阔场景，若长时间没有固定解时，先按[RTK 状态与固定解验证](../operation/rtk-fixed-"
"validation.md)排查差分链路和卫星环境。"
msgstr ""
"When the equipment is not fixed, first check the correction link and "
"satellite environment according to [RTK Status and Fixed Solution "
"Validation](../operation/rtk-fixed-validation.md)."

#: ../../source/rtk/integrations/jetson-raspberry-pi.md:181
msgid "Viobot2 的专用流程请查看[接入 Viobot2](viobot2.md)。"
msgstr "For the dedicated process of Viobot2, see [Access Viobot2](viobot2.md)."

